              "name": "Does the sync push invoices automatically or wait for approval?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Approval-gated is the correct configuration. The ERP marks an invoice ready, a person with billing authority reviews it, and only then does it post to QuickBooks. Fully automatic push sounds efficient and produces posted invoices with wrong PO numbers that then need credit memos on both sides."
              }
