                "text": "Between $2,082 and $6,283 all-in for a sponsored candidate. API's examination and application fee is $875 for members and $1,125 for non-members. Prep runs $999 for a self-paced online course or $4,950 for a five-day instructor-led online course. One travel day to a Prometric centre adds $178 to $208 at federal per diem rates. Recertification then costs $745 every three years."
