              "name": "How quickly can a contracted Level III be named in our written practice?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "The naming is a revision to the document: new revision number, the individual and their qualified methods added to the designation section, employer and Level III signatures, superseded copies withdrawn. The work ahead of it is verification — confirming the certificate is current in each method being named and that the methods actually match your service list. Firms with an accurate method matrix move immediately."
              }
