                "text": "The raw acquisition files in native format, the scan plan, the written procedure, the calibration and reference block records, the personnel qualification records, the weld map or drawing, and the report itself. If encoder verification records exist, send those too. We will tell you within the first pass whether the data set is complete enough to support the conclusions you need, and what is missing if it is not."
