                "text": "API reports 21,996 API 510 certifications held as of 30 April 2026, up from 17,709 five years earlier, so demand has not softened. Whether it pays back for a specific engineer depends on the deliverables they will sign, which is the argument worked through in [is API 510 certification worth it in 2026](/blog/api-510-certification-worth-it-2026)."
