                "text": "Yes in every practical sense. Phased array is a technique within ultrasonic testing, so the certification you hold is UT Level II with documented phased array technique training. The set-up decisions — velocity, refraction, attenuation, reference level — are conventional ultrasonic reasoning applied across many beams."
